   "content": {
    "title": "70 years of Bravo – a journey through time in pictures",
    "lead": "The cult magazine shaped many generations. At its peak, Bravo was available weekly at kiosks with a circulation of 1.8 million copies. Today, only 45,000 copies are printed monthly. But the memories remain unforgettable. We look back.",
